{"seq":1,"slug":"maternal-and-child-nursing","title":"母婴护理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/nursing/specialty-nursing/maternal-and-child-nursing","wordCount":1086,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"母婴护理\">母婴护理</h1><p>在产科实习的第一个夜班，我亲眼看到一位产妇产后突然大出血，护士在几分钟内按压子宫、建立通道、呼叫医生，整个过程紧张到我手心冒汗。那一刻我才真正理解，母婴护理为什么被称为&quot;一人变两人&quot;的高风险专科——你要同时守护母亲和孩子，而风险往往来得又快又凶。</p>\n<h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><ul>\n<li>妇产科护理贯穿<strong>孕期、分娩期、产褥期</strong>三个阶段，每个阶段都要同时关注母亲与胎儿/新生儿。</li>\n<li><strong>产前检查</strong> 的核心是监测胎儿宫内安危和孕妇并发症（如妊娠期高血压、妊娠期糖尿病）。</li>\n<li><strong>分娩期护理</strong> 关注产程进展、胎心监护、产妇配合与情绪支持。</li>\n<li><strong>产褥期（产后）护理</strong> 重点是观察子宫复旧、恶露、会阴/切口，警惕产后出血和感染。</li>\n<li><strong>新生儿护理</strong> 关注保暖、喂养、脐部护理、黄疸观察和早期亲子接触。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"孕期护理-守住两条线\">孕期护理：守住两条线</h3><p>孕期护理同时盯母亲和胎儿两条线。母亲一侧重点是血压和血糖——妊娠期高血压可能发展为子痫，妊娠期糖尿病影响母婴。胎儿一侧靠数胎动和胎心监护：教会孕妇自数胎动，胎动突然减少或剧增都可能是胎儿缺氧的信号。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分娩期-产程与胎心\">分娩期：产程与胎心</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[第一产程: 宫口扩张] --&gt; B[第二产程: 胎儿娩出]&#10;    B --&gt; C[第三产程: 胎盘娩出]&#10;    C --&gt; D[第四产程: 产后2小时观察]\">flowchart LR\n    A[第一产程: 宫口扩张] --&gt; B[第二产程: 胎儿娩出]\n    B --&gt; C[第三产程: 胎盘娩出]\n    C --&gt; D[第四产程: 产后2小时观察]</pre><p>很多人不知道还有&quot;第四产程&quot;——产后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 小时是产后出血的高发期，护士必须密切观察子宫收缩、阴道流血量和生命体征。分娩全程要持续监测胎心，正常胎心率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>110</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∼</mo><mn>160</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">110{\\sim}160</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">110</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span></span><span class=\"mord\">160</span></span></span></span></span> 次/分，持续异常提示胎儿窘迫。</p>\n<h3 id=\"产后护理-盯住-宫缩-和-恶露\">产后护理：盯住&quot;宫缩&quot;和&quot;恶露&quot;</h3><p>产后出血是孕产妇死亡的首要原因，而宫缩乏力又是产后出血最常见的病因。所以产后护理第一要务是观察子宫收缩——子宫应该硬如球状，若软、轮廓不清，要立即按摩刺激宫缩并报告。恶露的变化也是窗口：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>恶露类型</th>\n<th>大致时间</th>\n<th>颜色</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>血性恶露</td>\n<td>产后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∼</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3{\\sim}4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span></span></span></span></span> 天</td>\n<td>红色，含较多血液</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>浆液性恶露</td>\n<td>产后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∼</mo><mn>14</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4{\\sim}14</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span></span><span class=\"mord\">14</span></span></span></span></span> 天</td>\n<td>淡红色</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>白色恶露</td>\n<td>产后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∼</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2{\\sim}3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 周</td>\n<td>白色或淡黄</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>若血性恶露持续过久或有臭味，提示子宫复旧不良或感染。</p>\n<h3 id=\"新生儿护理要点\">新生儿护理要点</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>保暖</strong>：新生儿体温调节差，娩出后立即擦干、贴身保暖，预防低体温。</li>\n<li><strong>喂养</strong>：鼓励早接触、早吸吮、早开奶，母乳是首选。</li>\n<li><strong>脐部护理</strong>：保持干燥清洁，观察有无红肿渗液。</li>\n<li><strong>黄疸观察</strong>：生理性黄疸多在出生后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∼</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2{\\sim}3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 天出现、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">∼</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7{\\sim}10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 天消退；若过早、过重或持续不退，要警惕病理性黄疸。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>为什么说产后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 小时（第四产程）是护理观察的关键期？主要防什么？</li>\n<li>产后检查子宫时摸到子宫软、轮廓不清，你应该立即做什么？</li>\n<li>正常胎心率范围是多少？持续异常提示什么？</li>\n<li>怎样区分生理性黄疸和病理性黄疸？区分的意义在哪里？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>了解胎心监护图（CTG）的基本判读，理解护士如何通过曲线提前发现胎儿窘迫。</li>\n<li>关注母乳喂养的&quot;三早&quot;原则（早接触、早吸吮、早开奶）及其对母婴的好处。</li>\n<li>查阅产后出血的护理应急流程，体会&quot;分秒必争&quot;在产科意味着什么。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>母婴护理是&quot;一人守两人&quot;的高风险专科。孕期同时盯母亲的血压血糖和胎儿的胎动胎心；分娩期关注产程和胎心，别忘了产后 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> 小时的第四产程；产后第一要务是观察宫缩防出血，恶露变化是子宫复旧的窗口；新生儿护理记住保暖、喂养、脐部、黄疸四件事。这个专科最考验的是对突发出血和胎儿窘迫的快速反应。下一节我们看另一类特殊人群——儿童。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"母婴护理","id":"母婴护理"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"孕期护理：守住两条线","id":"孕期护理-守住两条线"},{"level":3,"text":"分娩期：产程与胎心","id":"分娩期-产程与胎心"},{"level":3,"text":"产后护理：盯住\"宫缩\"和\"恶露\"","id":"产后护理-盯住-宫缩-和-恶露"},{"level":3,"text":"新生儿护理要点","id":"新生儿护理要点"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"重症监护基础","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/nursing/medical-surgical-nursing/critical-care-monitoring-basics"},"next":{"title":"儿科护理要点","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/nursing/specialty-nursing/pediatric-nursing-essentials"}}